return ['domain'=>'zinn-offload','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-offload','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:28:39+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:28:39+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Media Offload'=>'Zinn® Media Offload','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload','Moves this site\'s media library to Zinn® object storage and serves it from a CDN. Configured from your Zinn® dashboard — no access key is ever typed into WordPress.'=>'Hushamisha maktaba ya vyombo vya habari ya tovuti hii hadi kwenye hifadhi ya vipengee ya Zinn® na kuihudumia kutoka kwenye CDN. Imesanidiwa kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn® — hakuna ufunguo wa kufikia unaowahi kuandikwa kwenye WordPress.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Imehifadhiwa. Andika thamani mpya ili kuibadilisha.','Filter this list…'=>'Chuja orodha hii…','Filter this list'=>'Chuja orodha hii','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Hakuna kinacholingana na kichujio hicho.','Add a row'=>'Ongeza safu mlalo','Remove this row'=>'Ondoa safu mlalo hii','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — muhtasari','Overview'=>'Muhtasari','Copied'=>'Imenakiliwa','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kila programu-jalizi ya Zinn® kwenye tovuti hii, na ikiwa inafanya kazi.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Hakuna muunganisho unaohitajika kwa programu-jalizi hii.','Open settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kubadilisha mipangilio hii.','Settings sections'=>'Sehemu za mipangilio','Support'=>'Usaidizi','Save changes'=>'Hifadhi mabadiliko','Tools'=>'Zana','Export settings'=>'Hamisha mipangilio','Reset to defaults'=>'Rejesha kwenye chaguomsingi','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Hii itarudisha kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii kwenye chaguomsingi yake. Ungependa kuendelea?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Uchunguzi wa utambuzi kwa ajili ya usaidizi','Import a settings file'=>'Leta faili la mipangilio','Import'=>'Ingiza','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faili zilizohamishwa hazina manenosiri, tokeni au funguo za API — utahitaji kuziweka tena kwenye tovuti mpya.','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii umerejeshwa kwenye chaguomsingi yake.','Done.'=>'Imekamilika.','That action is not available.'=>'Kitendo hicho hakipatikani.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faili hilo halikuweza kusomwa. Chagua faili la mipangilio lililohamishwa kutoka kwenye programu-jalizi ya Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faili hiyo ni kubwa mno kuwa uhamishaji wa mipangilio.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faili hiyo siyo uhamishaji wa mipangilio ya Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faili hiyo ilihamishwa kutoka kwa programu-jalizi tofauti (%s), kwa hivyo kuiingiza hapa kutahifadhi mipangilio ambayo programu-jalizi hii haielewi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Mpangilio %d umeingizwa. Manenosiri na vitufe vya API havijumuishwi kwenye uhamishaji, kwa hivyo viweke tena.' . "\0" . 'Mipangilio %d imeingizwa. Manenosiri na vitufe vya API havijumuishwi kamwe kwenye uhamishaji, kwa hivyo viingize tena.','Zinn Digital® did not return a token. Nothing has been changed on this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® haijarudisha tokeni. Hakuna chochote kilichobadilishwa kwenye tovuti hii.','This site is no longer connected to Zinn® media offload. New uploads will stay on this server. Pair it again from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Tovuti hii haijaunganishwa tena na upakuaji wa media wa Zinn®. Upakiaji mpya utabaki kwenye seva hii. Ioanishe tena kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® answered with HTTP %d.'=>'Zinn Digital® imejibu kwa HTTP %d.','Disconnected by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Imetenganishwa na Zinn Digital®.','Connected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Connecting…'=>'Inaunganisha…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini kuna jambo linalohitaji uangalifu','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Running on your own account'=>'Inatumika kwenye akaunti yako mwenyewe','We could not check this'=>'Hatuwezi kuangalia hili','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Programu-jalizi hii haikueleza sababu. Tuma ripoti ya utambuzi na tutaiangalia.','Connection status'=>'Hali ya muunganisho','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Ilikaguliwa mara ya mwisho %s iliyopita.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(hufunguka kwenye kichupo kipya)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Hiki ndicho hasa kitakachotumwa — hakuna kingine, na hakuna kilichofichwa. Nywila zako, tokeni na funguo za API hazimo.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ripoti ya uchunguzi itakayotumwa','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nakili kwenye ubao wa kunakili','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma ripoti hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Tunakufungulia tiketi ya usaidizi na kujibu kwa barua pepe. Ikiwa ungependa kutoituma, inakili hapo juu na uibandike mwenyewe kwenye tiketi.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Hatuwezi kufikia Zinn Digital® kutoka kwa seva hii (%s). Nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu na ufungue tikiti badala yake — hakuna hitilafu yoyote katika mipangilio yako.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Imetumwa. Usaidizi wa Zinn® umepokea ripoti yako na utajibu kupitia barua pepe.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Imetumwa. Usaidizi wa Zinn® umepokea ripoti yako — rejeleo %s — na utajibu kwa barua pepe.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Umetuma ripoti kadhaa kwa muda mfupi. Subiri dakika chache kisha ujaribu tena — zile za awali zilifika.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kupokea ripoti sasa hivi — hilo ni tatizo la upande wetu, si lako. Jaribu tena baada ya muda mfupi, au nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu kwenye tiketi.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Ripoti ilikataliwa (HTTP %d). Inakili hapo juu na ufungue tiketi, ukitaja nambari hiyo.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya mtumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Uyezo wa Zinn® kwa WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamishaji wa bila malipo na paneli dhibiti iliyoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha tovuti zaidi ya moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizothibitiwa, vikoa na upangaji wa viungo, huku pesa zikiwekwa salama hadi pande zote mbili ziridhike.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri watu ambao hufanya kazi hii ili kujipatia riziki','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari zaidi ya huduma 10,000 zilizotengenezwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, wasanidi programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwape nafasi ya kutoa zabuni.','Media Offload'=>'Uhamishaji wa Vyombo vya Habari','Connection'=>'Muunganisho','What gets moved'=>'Kinachohamishwa','How media is served'=>'Jinsi maudhui ya media yanavyohudumiwa','Move a batch now'=>'Hamisha fungu sasa','Media already moved is never affected by a change here — its address does not change.'=>'Vyombo vya habari ambavyo tayari vimehamishwa haviathiriwi kamwe na mabadiliko hapa — anwani yake haibadiliki.','New uploads'=>'Vipakiaji vipya','Move new uploads to Zinn® storage as they arrive'=>'Hamisha vipakizi vipya kwenye hifadhi ya Zinn® vinapowasili','Existing media'=>'Midia iliyopo','Keep moving the media library that is already here'=>'Endelea kuhamisha maktaba ya midia ambayo tayari iko hapa','A few files an hour, in the background, picking up where it left off. Turning this off pauses it; nothing already moved comes back.'=>'Faili chache kwa saa, chinichini, ikiendelea pale ilipoishia. Kuzima hii kutaipumzisha; hakuna chochote kilichokwisha kuhamishwa kitakachorudi.','Files per hourly pass'=>'Faili kwa kila upitaji wa saa','Each attachment is several files and every one is a full upload. Raise this on a fast host with a generous execution limit; lower it if passes are being cut short.'=>'Kila kiambatisho kinajumuisha faili kadhaa na kila moja ni upakiaji kamili. Ongeza thamani hii kwenye seva pangishi ya haraka iliyo na kikomo kikubwa cha utekelezaji; ipunguze ikiwa mizunguko inakatizwa kabla ya kukamilika.','Leave files smaller than'=>'Acha faili ndogo kuliko','Kilobytes. A tiny icon costs more in the extra connection than it saves in disk, so there is rarely a reason to move one. Set to 0 to move everything.'=>'Kilobaiti. Ikoni ndogo hugharimu zaidi kwenye muunganisho wa ziada kuliko inavyohifadhi kwenye diski, kwa hivyo ni nadra kuwa na sababu ya kuihamisha. Weka 0 ili kuhamisha kila kitu.','Never move these types'=>'Usiwahi kuhamisha aina hizi','Useful when a plugin reads a file straight off the disk — a font, a PDF a form builder stamps, an audio file a player seeks inside.'=>'Inafaa wakati programu-jalizi inasoma faili moja kwa moja kutoka kwenye diski — fonti, PDF iliyogongwa muhuri na kijenzi cha fomu, faili ya sauti ambayo kichezaji hutafuta ndani yake.','These two are the ones to be careful with — read each description before changing it.'=>'Hizi mbili ndizo za kuwa nazo makini — soma kila maelezo kabla ya kuibadilisha.','Serve from Zinn® storage'=>'Hudumia kutoka hifadhi ya Zinn®','Point image and file addresses at Zinn® storage'=>'Elekeza anwani za picha na faili kwenye hifadhi ya Zinn®','Off, files are uploaded but still served from this server — which is the safe state while you check everything arrived. On, visitors are served from storage and this server stops carrying the traffic.'=>'Imezimwa, faili zimepakiwa lakini bado zinatolewa kutoka kwa seva hii — ambayo ndiyo hali salama wakati unakagua ikiwa kila kitu kimefika. Imewashwa, wageni wanahudumiwa kutoka kwenye hifadhi na seva hii inaacha kubeba trafiki.','Free the disk space'=>'Pata nafasi ya diski','Delete the local copy once every size has uploaded'=>'Futa nakala ya ndani mara tu kila saizi inapopakiwa','This is the point of offloading, and it is also the irreversible half. Leave it off until “Serve from Zinn® storage” is on and you have checked your site — a local copy is the only thing that saves you if something was missed.'=>'Hili ndilo kusudi la upakuaji, na pia ni nusu isiyoweza kubadilishwa. Iache ikiwa imezimwa hadi “Serve from Zinn® storage” iwashwe na uwe umekagua tovuti yako — nakala ya ndani ndiyo kitu pekee kinachokuokoa ikiwa kuna kitu kilikosekana.','Deleting local copies cannot be undone from this screen. Take a backup first — the Zinn® Connector plugin can do that for you.'=>'Kufuta nakala za ndani hakuwezi kutenduliwa kutoka skrini hii. Chukua nakala rudufu kwanza — programu-jalizi ya Zinn® Connector inaweza kukufanyia hivyo.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage yet, so there is nowhere to move media to.'=>'Tovuti hii bado haijaunganishwa kwenye hifadhi ya Zinn®, kwa hivyo hakuna mahali pa kuhamishia midia.','%d attachment moved.'=>'%d kiambatisho kimehamishwa.' . "\0" . 'Viambatisho %d vimehamishwa.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage.'=>'Tovuti hii haijaunganishwa kwenye hifadhi ya Zinn®.','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Media stays on this server until it is.'=>'Hakuna tatizo lolote — bado haijaunganishwa tu. Faili za vyombo vya habari zitasalia kwenye seva hii hadi itakapounganishwa.','Connected, but the last upload failed.'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini upakiaji wa mwisho haukufaulu.','Try a batch now'=>'Jaribu kundi sasa','Connected. Every attachment has been moved.'=>'Imeunganishwa. Kila kiambatisho kimehamishwa.','Connected. %1$s of %2$s attachments still on this server.'=>'Imeunganishwa. Viambatisho %1$s kati ya %2$s bado viko kwenye seva hii.','Moved so far'=>'Imehamishwa hadi sasa','%1$s files, %2$s'=>'faili %1$s, %2$s','Still on this server'=>'Bado kiko kwenye seva hii','%1$s of %2$s attachments'=>'%1$s kati ya viambatisho %2$s','Served from'=>'Inatoka kwa','this server'=>'seva hii','Connect this site'=>'Unganisha tovuti hii','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, choose this site, open Files & databases, and press “Get a pairing code” under Images & video CDN. Paste the code below.'=>'Fungua dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®, chagua tovuti hii, fungua Faili na hifadhidata, kisha ubonyeze "Pata msimbo wa kuoanisha" chini ya CDN ya Picha na video. Bandika msimbo hapa chini.','Pairing code'=>'Nambari ya kuoanisha','Disconnect this site'=>'Tenganisha tovuti hii','New uploads will stay on this server. Media already moved keeps working — its address does not change.'=>'Vipakiaji vipya vitasalia kwenye seva hii. Vyombo vya habari vilivyohamishwa tayari vinaendelea kufanya kazi — anwani yake haibadiliki.','You do not have permission to manage this site.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kudhibiti tovuti hii.','Paste the pairing code from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Bandika msimbo wa kuoanisha kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®.','Connected. New uploads will be stored with Zinn Digital® from now on, and your existing media will move in the background.'=>'Imeunganishwa. Upakiaji mpya utahifadhiwa kwenye Zinn Digital® kuanzia sasa, na faili zako za midia zilizopo zitahamishwa chinichini.','Disconnected. Media already moved keeps working; new uploads stay on this server.'=>'Imetenganishwa. Midia ambayo tayari imehamishwa inaendelea kufanya kazi; vipakizi vipya vinabaki kwenye seva hii.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'Faili hiyo haikuweza kusomwa kutoka kwa seva hii, kwa hivyo hakuna kilichopakiwa.','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kutiririsha upakiaji, kwa hivyo hakuna kilichotumwa.','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'Faili hili lina ukubwa wa %1$s na PHP ya tovuti hii haina cURL, kwa hivyo faili kubwa zaidi inayoweza kupakia ni %2$s.','The upload could not be completed.'=>'Upakiaji haukuweza kukamilika.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'Hifadhi imekataa upakiaji (HTTP %d).','Style preset'=>'Weka mapema mtindo','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Mahali pa kuanzia. Chochote kilicho hapa chini kinakibadilisha.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Tumia rangi na saizi zangu mwenyewe','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Acha hii ikiwa imezimwa na seti ya awali itatumika vile vile ilivyo.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama madokezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Huduma ya kusasisha ya Zinn® haikutoa kiungo cha kupakua kwa sasisho hili. Angalia ikiwa tovuti hii inaweza kufikia jukwaa la Zinn®, kisha ujaribu tena.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Sasisho halikuweza kupakuliwa kutoka kwa huduma ya sasisho ya Zinn® (%s). Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa uthibitishaji wa uadilifu na halijasakinishwa.']];